# Merge drivers for AI evidence files
#
# factory-log.jsonl is append-only; the union driver takes all lines from
# both sides without producing conflict markers, which is exactly right.
#
# The generated report files (REPORT.md, report.js, report.json) use a
# custom "evidence-regen" driver defined in .git/config (installed by
# .claude/hooks/install-merge-drivers.sh) that simply accepts our version
# and lets the post-merge hook regenerate the correct content.
# If the driver isn't configured yet, fall back to union (temporarily
# wrong content, fixed immediately by the post-merge hook).

.claude/factory-log.jsonl       merge=union
docs/ai-evidence/REPORT.md      merge=evidence-regen
docs/ai-evidence/report.js      merge=evidence-regen
docs/ai-evidence/report.json    merge=evidence-regen
